  "decision_date": "25/01/2007",
  "description": "Conversion of chalet bungalow into 3 No. one bedroom flats, together with the erection of an external staircase to the west side elevation of the building and an area of decking with balustrade at first floor level, 4 No. rooflights on the east side roofslope of the building, 1 No. rooflight on the west side roofslope, and windows and a door in the rear elevation at first floor level, alterations to existing extract duct, and provision of 3 No. off-street car parking spaces.",
