  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The three parking spaces and the gate shown on unnumbered block plan scale 1:200 received 13th December 2006 to be provided for the three residential units shall be marked out on the site for the exclusive use of the residential units in the positions shown prior to the first occupation of the residential units, and thereafter shall be retained in perpetuity.",
    "Condition : 3 - The extraction system of the caf? building shall be modified in accordance with drawing No. 26710/1 prior to the new residential units being occupied and shall comprise a three-stage filtration system to include a grease, pre-and carbon filter.  In addition, the ducting shall be isolated from the building structure, the fan unit shall be mounted on anti-vibrational mountings, and fan silencers shall be incorporated.  Thereafter, the equipment shall be retained and maintained in accordance with the manufacturers  pecifications.",
    "Condition : 4 - A scheme for protecting the residential units from road noise shall be implemented and shall include the building envelope being adapted so as to provide sound attenuation against external noise, to provide internal ambient sound levels to be within the levels stated as reasonable in BS 8233:1999 of a Laeq 23:00-7:00 of 35dB and a Lamax of 45dB in bedrooms and a Laeq 07:00-23:-- of 40 dB in living rooms.  The scheme shall also include the insulation of the roof, first floor window in the front gable end and the four roof lights in the flank roof slopes (excluding the velux Means of Escape), to achieve the BS 8233.",
    "Condition : 5 - Full details of the refuse storage facilities to be provided for the three residential units shall be submitted to and shall be approved by the local planning authority prior to the development being commenced.  Such details as may be approved, and which shall include measures for recycling, shall be implemented as approved and thereafter retained.",
    "Condition : 6 - Full details of the staircase, first floor decking and privacy screen to scale 1:20 shall be submitted to and shall be approved in writing by the local planning authority prior to the development being commenced, and the details which may be subsequently approved shall be implemented as approved and thereafter retained. Details shall include samples of the materials, including the proposed glazing.",
    "Condition : 7 - The materials to be used in the formation of any additional openings in the building i.e. windows and doors, shall match in appearance those used on the existing building.",
    "Condition : 8 - ."
  ],
